    "router": "<!-- nobrainer-routing:start -->\n## Model routing for nobrainer-tech-flow\n\nGenerated at nobrainer.tech/benchmark from Artificial Analysis data of 29 September 2026. Models change fast, so regenerate it every few weeks.\n\nMain agent\n- High-stakes work (architecture, hard debugging, risky changes): Alpha 2, reasoning xhigh (openai/alpha-2).\n- Everyday work: Beta 5, reasoning high (anthropic/beta-5).\n\nSubagents, in this order. If one is unavailable or out of quota, use the next:\n1. Alpha 2, reasoning xhigh (openai/alpha-2)\n2. Beta 5, reasoning high (anthropic/beta-5)\n\nModel per job\n- Coding: Alpha 2, reasoning xhigh (openai/alpha-2).\n- Cheap bulk work: Gamma Mini, reasoning medium (openai/gamma-mini).\n- Time does not matter: take the higher score or the lower cost, even if a task takes longer.\n<!-- nobrainer-routing:end -->",
